    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Keuz Krusade</i> is a single-player, strategy game where myth and emotion intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a general tasked with building and defending a mystical kingdom \u2014 not just with bricks and walls, but with belief, emotion, and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path opens a unique series of quests, allies, and storylines inspired by Brazilian cultural heritage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is fueled by a single powerful resource: <strong>Dawk</strong> \u2014 the energy of emotions like love, fear, and rage. Use it to build, unlock upgrades, and interact with spiritual beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll defend your lands against cosmic invaders, construct sacred structures, and make decisions that ripple through the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether guided by ancestral spirits or divine orix\u00e1s, your kingdom will become a reflection of the path you\u2019ve chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Keuz Krusade</i> is a single-player, strategy game where myth and emotion intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a general tasked with building and defending a mystical kingdom \u2014 not just with bricks and walls, but with belief, emotion, and purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each path opens a unique series of quests, allies, and storylines inspired by Brazilian cultural heritage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is fueled by a single powerful resource: <strong>Dawk</strong> \u2014 the energy of emotions like love, fear, and rage. Use it to build, unlock upgrades, and interact with spiritual beings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll defend your lands against cosmic invaders, construct sacred structures, and make decisions that ripple through the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether guided by ancestral spirits or divine orix\u00e1s, your kingdom will become a reflection of the path you\u2019ve chosen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Forge your kingdom and shape your destiny in Keuz Krusade, a single-player strategy game inspired by Brazilian mythology. Align ancient forest spirits or the sacred divine \u2014 your choices will define the fate of the realm.",
